          {
            "title": "Websites",
            "id": 71324,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vediamo come funzionano i link per combinare <strong>pagine web</strong> in <strong>siti web</strong>. Fai clic su <code>Take a break!</code> per usare il link.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA; &lt;style&gt;&#xA;  body {&#xA;   background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #a1c4fd, #c2e9fb);&#xA;   text-align: center;&#xA;   font-family: &quot;Verdana&quot;, Sans-serif;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  img {&#xA;   margin: 40px;&#xA;   height: 40px;&#xA;   width: 150px;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  h1 {&#xA;   margin-top: 30px;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  h3 {&#xA;   margin: 20px;&#xA;   font-weight: normal;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  p {&#xA;   margin-top: 80px;&#xA;   margin-left: 30px;&#xA;   margin-right: 30px;&#xA;   padding: 20px;&#xA;   background-color: DimGray;&#xA;  }&#xA; &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA; &lt;h1&gt;Need five?&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;a&#xA;  href=&quot;https://google.com&quot;&gt;Take a&#xA;  break!&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Links",
            "id": 70808,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per iniziare a creare un link, aggiungi il testo tra i tag <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>. Il testo non verrà ancora evidenziato.</p><p><code>&lt;a&gt;</code> indica il tag \"Anchor\".</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per iniziare a creare un link, aggiungi il testo tra i tag <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>. Il testo non verrà ancora evidenziato.</p><p><code>&lt;a&gt;</code> indica il tag \"Anchor\".</p><p>Componi l'elemento in modo che <code>Learn to Code</code> si trovi tra i tag anchor di apertura e di chiusura.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;anchor&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/anchor&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;Learn to Code&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>Learn to Code</code> e infine <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Links",
            "id": 70811,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per collegare il testo a una pagina web, aggiungiamo <code>href=\"\"</code> insieme a un Uniform Resource Locator (<strong>URL</strong>). <code>href</code> è l'abbreviazione di \"hypertext reference\".</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>href</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"https://mimo.org\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>href=\"\"</code> collega il testo a un URL. Completa il tag di apertura in modo che il link porti a <code>https://mimo.org</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"1\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"src\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;href&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>a</code>, seguito da <code>href</code>, <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"https://mimo.org\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Attributes",
            "id": 70809,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>href</code> è un <strong>attributo</strong>. Tutti gli attributi hanno due cose in comune: forniscono informazioni aggiuntive e si trovano all'interno del tag di apertura.</p><p>Gli attributi vengono aggiunti dopo il nome del tag e prima del segno di chiusura <code>&gt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gli attributi forniscono informazioni aggiuntive e si trovano all'interno del tag di apertura.</p><p>L'attributo <code>href</code> imposta l'URL di destinazione, cioè l'indirizzo web, di un link.</p><p>Inserisci <code>href</code> dopo il nome del tag, poi completa il tag di apertura con <code>&gt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"a\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;href&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/a&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>href</code>, seguito da <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Equal sign",
            "id": 70810,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Colleghiamo a una pagina web aggiungendo <code>=</code> dopo l'attributo e un URL come valore tra virgolette.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>\"</code> e poi <code>https://mimo.org</code>, <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Colleghiamo a una pagina web aggiungendo <code>=</code> dopo l'attributo e un URL come valore tra virgolette.</p><p>Completa il link affinché il valore di <code>href</code> sia esattamente <code>https://mimo.org</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"a\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/a&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>href</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>, <code>\"</code>, <code>https://mimo.org</code> e infine <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Create a link",
            "id": 117993,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un tag di apertura <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> con l'attributo <code>href</code> impostato su <code>\"https://mimo.org\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>href</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"https://mimo.org\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea il tag anchor di apertura che collega a <code>https://mimo.org</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"1\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"src\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;</code>, seguito da <code>a</code>, <code>href</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>\"https://mimo.org\"</code> e infine <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 70812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa servono i link?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Collega le pagine web ad altre pagine web e siti web</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Metti in risalto il testo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Collega le pagine web ad altre pagine web e siti web.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un visitatore fa clic sul testo in un tag anchor con un <code>href</code> funzionante. Che cosa può fare il link?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Portare il visitatore a un'altra pagina web o a un altro sito web</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mettere soltanto in risalto il testo sulla pagina</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Inviare il testo come dati di un modulo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Portare il visitatore a un'altra pagina web o a un altro sito web.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 70813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché il link non funziona?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché non ha l'attributo <code>href</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché non contiene testo tra <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché non ha l'attributo <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il testo è all'interno dei tag anchor, ma facendo clic non si può ancora aprire un'altra pagina web. Perché?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché il tag di apertura non ha un attributo <code>href</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché il testo del tag anchor non è tra virgolette</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Perché la destinazione deve trovarsi nel tag di chiusura</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché il tag di apertura non ha un attributo <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 70814,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando un visitatore fa clic sul link di questa pagina web?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Where Developers Learn, Share,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   &amp; Build Careers\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il link indirizza l'utente a un altro sito web</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nulla, perché manca l'attributo <code>href</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il link indirizza l'utente a un altro sito web.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nel codice mostrato, che cosa determina dove va il visitatore dopo aver fatto clic sul link?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Where Developers Learn, Share,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   &amp; Build Careers\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'URL memorizzato nell'attributo <code>href</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Le parole tra <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> e <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">L'indirizzo della pagina web che contiene il link</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">L'URL memorizzato nell'attributo <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 70815,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa servono gli <code>attributes</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per fornire informazioni aggiuntive sui tag</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Trasformare tutti i tag in link</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per fornire informazioni aggiuntive sui tag.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In <code>&lt;a href=\"https://mimo.org\"&gt;</code>, a cosa serve l'attributo <code>href</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fornisce informazioni aggiuntive sul tag</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sostituisce il testo mostrato sulla pagina</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Trasforma il tag anchor in un elemento diverso</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fornisce informazioni aggiuntive sul tag.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 70816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli il tag di apertura che rende il link cliccabile.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://cars.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Buy a car\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;a&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;a href=\"https://cars.com\"&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il tag di apertura in modo che <code>Buy a car</code> colleghi a <code>https://cars.com</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://cars.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Buy a car\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;a&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"src\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Buy a car\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;a</code>, seguito da <code>href</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>\"https://cars.com\"</code> e infine <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 70818,
            "contentType": "interactive",
