            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi l'attributo e il relativo valore in modo che, facendo clic sul link, gli utenti vengano indirizzati al sito web di Facebook.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://facebook.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Like us on Facebook\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"30\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>href</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"https://facebook.com\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
